/T (Germany is facing a huge shortage of qualified doctors for quite a number of years now. There is a need throughout Germany for several thousand additional doctors. This demand will continue to rise in the coming years. Germany faces a massive lack of medical care personnel, which means many hospitals are overburdened. Currently, roughly 1 million people work in the country's healthcare industry and are paid most handsomely for their services.)
