/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 116 0 R
/ActualText (Within 2 years, doctors have to learn as much as they can from their German colleagues and professors and give the medical knowledge exam to recognize their Indian \(foreign\) medical degree. Doctors will have 3 chances to pass the knowledge exam in their state and have to score 50% marks. If a doctor can not pass this exam in 3 chances, he/she can try to change the state and get 2 years temporary license in another state and give the knowledge exam. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
