201 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 116 0 R
/ActualText (Once a doctor passes the knowledge exam, he/she becomes a permanent/licensed doctor in whole of Germany and becomes eligible to start his PG. As there is no entrance exam in Germany for PG, company will assist in finding PG positions, apply \(according to doctors preferred specialization\) and help in the whole process through local hospitals and Universities. It can be possible to recognize the JRship years in PG period also. Total duration of PG is 5 years and all the super specializations like Cardiology, Urology, Cardiac surgery, etc. are available.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
